                                <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/> ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡
                                ሕማመ፡ ዓይነ፡ ጽላ፡ ወጽላ<supplied reason="omitted"
                                    resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">፡</supplied> ወጊ፡ ወርእስ፡ <choice
