                                    <sic>መ</sic>
                                    <corr>ም</corr>
                                </choice>ትአት፡ ያሸኤር<supplied reason="omitted"
                                    resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">፡</supplied> ይአኢርር፡ ያሸኢርር፡<gap
                                    reason="ellipsis" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/> ግርማኤል፡ አማኑኤል፡
